        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Imana iburira Abefurayimu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ikamba ry'ubwibone bw'abasinzi bo mu Befurayimu rizabona ishyano, n'ururabyo rw'ubwiza bw'icyubahiro cye rurabye ruri mu mutwe w'ikibaya kirumbuka cy'abagushwa na vino, na rwo rubone ishyano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dore Uwiteka afite umunyamaboko w'intwari, ni we uzabakubita hasi cyane nk'amahindu y'urubura, nk'amashahi arimbura n'amazi menshi y'umwuzure arenga inkombe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze ikamba ry'ubwibone bw'abasinzi bo mu Befurayimu rizakandagirwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi ururabyo rw'ubwiza bw'icyubahiro cye rurabye rwo mu mutwe w'ikibaya kirumbuka, na rwo ruzamera nk'imbuto y'umutini inetse mbere icyi kitarasohora. Uyibonye arayisoroma, yabona igeze mu ntoki ze akayiyongobeza rwose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwo munsi Uwiteka Nyiringabo azabera abantu be barokotse ikamba ry'icyubahiro n'umurimbo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "n'uwicara ku ntebe agaca imanza azamubera umwuka uca imanza zitabera, kandi abantu be azababera imbaraga baneshe urugamba rugeze mu marembo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko n'Abayuda na bo baradandabiranywa na vino, igisindisha kirabayobeje. Umutambyi n'umuhanuzi baradandabiranywa n'igisindisha, vino ibamazeho bayobejwe n'igishindisha. Iyo bagiye guhanura baradandabirana, iyo bagiye guca imanza barategwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ameza yose yuzuyeho ibirutsi n'imyanda, nta heza na hato.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Azigisha nde ubwenge? Kandi uwo azamenyesha ubutumwa ni nde? Ni abavuye ku ibere bacutse? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuko ibye ari ugutoza itegeko rikurikirwa n'irindi, itegeko ku itegeko, umurongo ku murongo, n'umurongo ku murongo, aha bikeya, hariya bikeya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CO.14.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Kor 14.21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ahubwo azavuganira n'ubu bwoko mu kanwa k'abanyamahanga b'urundi rurimi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ubwo bwoko ni bwo yabwiye ati “Uku ni ko kuruhuka mureke urushye aruhuke, aho ni ho buruhukiro.” Ariko banga kumva. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni cyo gituma kuri bo ijambo ry'Uwiteka rizaba itegeko ku itegeko, umurongo ku murongo, n'umurongo ku murongo, aha bikeya, hariya bikeya, bagende bagwe ngazi bavunike, bategwe bafatwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ibuye rikomeza impfuruka",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko rero nimwumve ijambo ry'Uwiteka mwa bakobanyi mwe, bategeka ubu bwoko buri i Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mugira ngo “Twasezeranye isezerano n'urupfu”, kandi ngo “Twuzuye n'ikuzimu. Ibyago nibisandara bigahitanya igihugu, ntibizatugeraho kuko twiboneye ubuhungiro mu binyoma tukaba twihishe mu buryarya.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.118.22+PSA.118.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zab 118.22-23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.9.33"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rom 9.33",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.10.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "10.11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1PE.2.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Pet 2.6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ni cyo gitumye Umwami Imana ivuga iti “Dore ndashyira muri Siyoni ibuye ry'urufatiro ryageragejwe, ibuye rikomeza impfuruka ry'igiciro cyinshi rishikamye cyane, kandi uwizera ntazahutiraho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi imanza zitabera ni zo nzagira umugozi ugera, no gukiranuka nzakugira timazi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amahindu azatsemba ibinyoma muhungiramo, kandi amazi azasendera mu bwihisho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze isezerano mwasezeranye n'urupfu rizapfa, kandi ubumwe mufitanye n'ikuzimu ntibuzahama, ahubwo ibyago nibisandara bigahitanya igihugu, buzabakandagirira hasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uko bizajya binyuramo bizabafata, kuko bizajya binyuramo uko bukeye ku manywa na nijoro, kandi kumenya ubutumwa kuzaba gutera ubwoba gusa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erega, urutara ni rugufi umuntu atarambirizaho, kandi ikirago ni intambure kitakwira umuntu! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.10.10+JOS.10.11+JOS.10.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yos 10.10-12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.5.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 5.20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.14.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Ngoma 14.11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Uwiteka azahaguruka nk'uko yahagurutse ku musozi Perasimu, azarakara nk'uko yarakariye mu kibaya cy'i Gibeyoni ngo akore umurimo we, ari wo murimo we w'inzaduka, uwo murimo we w'inzaduka azawusohoza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko mwe kugumya gukobana, kugira ngo ingoyi zanyu zitarushaho gukanaga, kuko numvise yuko ibyo Umwami Uwiteka Nyiringabo yagambiriye ari ukumaraho isi yose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nimutege amatwi munyumve, nimwumvirize mwumve amagambo yanjye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Urimira kuzabiba, ahora arima iteka, ahora acoca amasinde iteka? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iyo amaze kuyasanza ntaherako akamisha uburo, akabiba kumino, akabiba ingano mu mirongo, na sayiri akayibiba ahayikwiriye, akabiba na kusemati ku mbibi zaho? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuko Imana ye imwerekēra ikamwigisha neza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uburo ntibuhuzwa imihuzo y'ubugi, na kumino ntihonyozwa uruziga rw'igare, ahubwo uburo buhuzwa inkoni, na kumino ihuzwa inshyimbo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ingano z'umutsima umuntu ntiyahora azihura gusa ahubwo arazihera, kandi nubwo uruziga rw'igare rye n'inzara z'amafarashi ye bizihonyora, ntazisya ngo azinoze. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'ibyo na byo bituruka ku Uwiteka Nyiringabo, umujyanama utangaza agasumbya abantu bose ubwenge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
